/**
 * Domain Dependency Injection Hook
 *
 * AUTO-GENERATED by codegen (api_server_domain_dependencies). Do not edit by hand.
 * Regenerate with: pnpm run codegen (domain list from platform/api-server/src/domains rescan).
 *
 * Performance-optimized centralized dependency injection that matches domain from path
 * and injects only the needed domain dependencies. Dependencies are cached per domain.
 *
 * Usage:
 * ```typescript
 * fastify.addHook("preHandler", injectDomainDependencies);
 * ```
 *
 * Access dependencies in routes:
 * ```typescript
 * const deps = getDomainDeps(request, "content");
 * ```
 */

